DESCRIPTION:Hot off the heels of a wild year touring Canada and Australia i
 n 2025\, Melbourne Ska Orchestra just can't keep still. The spaghetti west
 ern wagon trail rolls on with the super deluxe edition of their acclaimed 
 album The Ballad of Monte Loco with all the faves\, plus a swag of brand-n
 ew tracks\, blistering live recordings\, and honky tonk renditions of MSO 
 staples. It's braver\, meaner and wilder than anything they've done before
 . So saddle up\, partner: this here posse is riding into a town near you\,
