DESCRIPTION:NINO BROWN – 90s RNB + URBAN NIGHT Australia’s No.1 Urban D
 J Nino Brown is bringing a massive 90s RNB\, hip hop and urban club night 
 to Queensland this September. A true Australian urban music institution\, 
 Nino Brown has performed across Australia and South East Asia\, sharing st
 ages with some of the biggest names in the world including Eminem\, Jay-Z\
 , Snoop Dogg\, Rihanna\, Busta Rhymes\, Akon\, Nelly\, T-Pain and Sean Pau
 l. Best known for his iconic Blazin’ mixtape series with Universal Music
  — which became one of the country’s biggest urban music compilations\
 , selling over 500\,000 copies — Nino has helped shape Australian RNB\, 
 hip hop and urban club culture for decades. Expect a full night of 90s RNB
  classics\, old-school hip hop\, throwback party anthems and urban club fa
 vourites\, delivered by one of the most recognised and respected DJs in th
 e country. Saturday 12 September – Kings Beach Tavern\, Caloundra Round 
 up the crew. This is a proper throwback RNB night.
LOCATION:Kings Beach Tavern\, Caloundra · Caloundra + Kawana
